WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.874
Submit your fanart to the Soul Contract producers here at: soulcontractanime.tumblr.com/submit

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:50.698
Soul Contract

00:01:53.132 --> 00:01:55.398
13th Contract

00:01:56.737 --> 00:01:59.460
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:02.713 --> 00:02:04.037
The bleeding won't stop!

00:02:04.037 --> 00:02:06.052
- You two come over here quickly
-Raise his upper body

00:02:06.052 --> 00:02:07.272
Bandage!

00:02:07.272 --> 00:02:08.098
Be careful

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:09.440
- Wait
- I'm coming

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:10.480
Bring the gauze too

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:11.910
- Sure
- Bring that over

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:12.700
Hurry, hurry

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:13.680
Call the hospital

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:15.260
Ready?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.280
- We're ready
- Careful

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.120
Slowly

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:20.454
We've given first-aid

00:02:20.454 --> 00:02:24.163
Unfortunately, Mr. Duanmu's condition is very bad

00:02:24.163 --> 00:02:25.163
I understand

00:02:25.163 --> 00:02:27.005
Let's send the Master home

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.920
Initiate the yang flaring ritual
(yang here refers to the yin and yang concept)

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:30.640
Bad news

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:33.560
Old Lady fainted after hearing about Master's accident

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:34.530
What?

00:02:41.718 --> 00:02:42.610
Qin Siyao

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:43.960
Duanmu Xi is...

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:52.990
Yang Jinghua

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:55.110
You're a jinx to the Duanmu family

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.840
Do you realize that you've committed a grave sin?

00:02:58.156 --> 00:02:59.076
I know

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:03.220
but shouldn't we think of a way to save him?

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:04.750
Still stubborn

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.240
Let's see how much

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.570
your spirit body

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:08.980
can endure my palm

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:09.380
Wait

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:10.140
Siyun

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:12.510
We don't have the right to punish Mr. Yang

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:15.520
Have you forgotten what the Master said before?

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:16.710
From now on,

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.700
whatever Yang Jinghua did,

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.980
no one except me

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:23.200
is allowed to punish him personally

00:03:23.204 --> 00:03:24.140
Are you mad?

00:03:24.158 --> 00:03:26.910
You know you can't easily control spirits

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:28.769
What if he injures you?

00:03:28.769 --> 00:03:31.241
Then only I will punish him

00:03:31.241 --> 00:03:32.893
He is my Soul Image

00:03:32.893 --> 00:03:37.611
It will not change the fact even after I die

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.900
I'll let you go for today

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:47.640
You may be exempted from death but you aren't exempted from punishment

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:48.590
Brother Siming

00:03:48.598 --> 00:03:50.226
Cage him up

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:54.560
He's not allowed to take a step out until the Master wakes up

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:56.060
I understand

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:56.830
Sorry,

00:03:56.832 --> 00:03:57.897
Mr. Yang

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.960
Please bear with this for a while

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.300
What are you guys planning to do?

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:12.310
W-What are you all doing?

00:04:12.314 --> 00:04:13.800
Duanmu Xi is in peril now

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:16.020
Why won't you send him to the hospital?

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:23.360
The Master

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.480
cannot accept any blood transfusion

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.680
Aren't you the Soul Image?

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:30.680
Don't you even know his Attained Soul condition?

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:31.790
What?

00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:33.334
Attained Soul

00:04:33.334 --> 00:04:36.129
is the type of body that is in the natural purest state

00:04:36.129 --> 00:04:40.532
This kind of body usually happens when a person has extremely high spiritual energy

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:43.020
Due to the overwhelming power in the body

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:45.170
Any external impurities

00:04:45.172 --> 00:04:47.578
are not allowed to come into contact

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:48.900
The Young Master

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:51.540
has to be extremely careful with his daily intake

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.900
He always eats vegan food and refrains from wine

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:56.890
A slight mistake will cause an adverse reaction

00:04:56.895 --> 00:04:58.459
Other people's blood

00:04:58.459 --> 00:05:01.389
is like poison to him

00:05:01.389 --> 00:05:03.611
Therefore, he mustn't be injured

00:05:03.611 --> 00:05:05.704
If he gets injured badly,

00:05:05.704 --> 00:05:07.676
his fiancée will have to

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:10.420
perform a ritual to flare his yang energy

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:13.520
Be it looks, backgrounds, conducts, or talents

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:15.960
The arranged future wife of Yangming Master

00:05:15.963 --> 00:05:17.992
only needs to fulfill one criterion:

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:20.590
To have a fiery yang physique

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.680
What is flaring yang ritual?

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.560
It's to transfer energy to extend life

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:27.340
Giving away one's life energy to another

00:05:39.671 --> 00:05:40.512
2nd Lady

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:42.960
I wish to privately speak to him

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.180
Go ahead

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:46.000
We will go check on great grandma

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:46.960
Yes

00:05:54.121 --> 00:05:55.404
Qin Siyao, listen to me

00:05:55.404 --> 00:05:56.869
I didn't intentionally do it

00:05:56.869 --> 00:05:58.594
I also don't know what happened

00:05:58.594 --> 00:06:00.433
After I woke up, he's already...

00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:01.900
You still act innocent?

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.540
Yangming Master is just a human

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.180
Not a superhuman

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:08.520
A Soul Image is supposed to be there to protect him

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:10.520
What have you done?

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.340
I really didn't intentionally do it

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:13.300
He has skills

00:06:13.308 --> 00:06:14.967
Why didn't he avoid?

00:06:14.967 --> 00:06:15.654
Because

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:18.360
he never takes precautions against you

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:22.040
Whether you know it or not

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.040
It's too late

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:24.000
What?

00:06:24.002 --> 00:06:26.022
Haven't you realized?

00:06:27.115 --> 00:06:29.210
After you came back tonight,

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:30.491
all the servants

00:06:30.491 --> 00:06:32.821
consider you a traitor

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:35.100
The old lady is very weak

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.320
She got panicked by the Master's situation

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:39.100
and caused great stress to her heart

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.060
Fortunately, we manage to save her in time,

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:41.480
else

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.100
she might not even make it

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.680
She needs to take medications and rest in bed

00:06:45.683 --> 00:06:48.553
You must avoid causing her any more stress

00:06:48.553 --> 00:06:49.763
I understand

00:06:49.763 --> 00:06:51.413
Thanks for your hard work

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:52.530
2nd lady

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.220
Everyone's gathered

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:55.240
Good

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.740
The Duanmu family has a long history

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:01.720
Their relationships with every tribe is a complicated affair

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:02.680
If anything happens,

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:03.860
everyone here has to act

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.380
Duanmu Xi's position wasn't decided within the household

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:08.440
It was Old Lady who quelled the disputes

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:10.400
and chose him to take up the position

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.750
He's not only talented and hardworking

00:07:12.754 --> 00:07:15.190
He also doesn't have any threatening influences

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:17.320
What he does will not cause conflicts

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:20.190
Therefore, it's like a double-edged sword

00:07:20.483 --> 00:07:21.999
Other than the Old Lady,

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.880
he doesn't get support from others

00:07:23.886 --> 00:07:25.244
I'm just a fiancée

00:07:25.244 --> 00:07:28.700
I have no position to speak against the Duanmu family

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:29.448
So,

00:07:29.448 --> 00:07:31.229
if anything happens to Duanmu...

00:07:31.229 --> 00:07:32.889
Now you know

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.600
Young Master is seriously injured and unconscious

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.570
The Old Lady is still in bad shape

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:38.800
Duanmu family

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.930
cannot have a day without leadership

00:07:40.936 --> 00:07:42.120
Starting today,

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.198
I, Duanmu Siyun, will

00:07:44.198 --> 00:07:46.416
temporary be the stand-in

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:51.702
Great grandma

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.880
I am still incapable

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.300
I don't have brother Xi's knowledge and strength

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.160
but I

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.560
will do my best

00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:00.320
to ensure stability in this family

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:01.900
I hope you

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.450
rest well

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:06.730
Brother Siming

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:10.660
From now on, the responsibility to take charge of this household depends on us

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:13.310
I won't hesitate to do it

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.220
Oh no

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.380
Duanmu Xi is in danger

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:16.480
Where is he now?

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.980
I must save him

00:08:18.023 --> 00:08:18.935
You?

00:08:18.935 --> 00:08:20.107
Save him?

00:08:20.107 --> 00:08:22.695
You're taken away from him what can you do?

00:08:22.695 --> 00:08:23.932
I...

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:25.399
Do you know

00:08:25.399 --> 00:08:26.992
after that ceremony

00:08:26.992 --> 00:08:29.103
his body is in the weakest state?

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.620
He slept for 3 days

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:33.380
He hasn't recovered but he still insisted on going out

00:08:33.384 --> 00:08:34.649
I told him not to go

00:08:34.649 --> 00:08:36.428
Do you know what he said?

00:08:36.428 --> 00:08:37.728
He must be

00:08:37.728 --> 00:08:39.557
longing to go home

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:41.920
When everyone thinks of Yangming Masters,

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:44.770
they only have an impression of young, refined people

00:08:44.774 --> 00:08:47.398
That's because no one has seen them grown old

00:08:47.398 --> 00:08:48.854
In reality,

00:08:48.854 --> 00:08:51.367
none of the Duanmu Masters, down the ages,

00:08:51.367 --> 00:08:53.538
has ever lived over 30

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:56.320
Yangming Masters are those who stand in this world

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:58.310
to intercede the netherworld

00:08:58.310 --> 00:09:01.306
They are bearers of a billion souls' prayers

00:09:01.306 --> 00:09:04.213
They have the power to comfort billions of souls

00:09:04.213 --> 00:09:06.133
In order to bring peace to the land,

00:09:06.133 --> 00:09:08.511
they have to pay the price with their own life

00:09:08.511 --> 00:09:11.759
Every ritual performance for Yangming Masters

00:09:11.759 --> 00:09:13.992
may be their last

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:17.800
So this was what he meant when he said those words

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:19.080
Who's there?

00:09:20.524 --> 00:09:23.258
Young Master had previously requested

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.220
to let Mr. Soul Image to take a look at this

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:28.540
This was ordered by Master prior to the ceremony

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:29.860
Please have a look

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:33.340
The clothes are weaved from spirit thread that can create defensive effect

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:36.760
It's to avoid incidents, similar to that caused by Situ Li, from happening

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.270
Young Master had spoken that

00:09:38.277 --> 00:09:39.993
since he is your master

00:09:39.993 --> 00:09:43.168
he's willing to do anything to protect you

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:49.000
I thought I've already known all about him

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.640
but I never knew

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:52.860
he would silently prepare this for you

00:09:52.869 --> 00:09:55.026
Now think over what you did to him

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.980
Don't you think it's such an irony?

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:57.800
Yes

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.450
I'm a bastard

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.980
who just let things happened

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:02.520
without any concern

00:10:02.524 --> 00:10:04.884
Too many things I'm afraid to ponder

00:10:05.181 --> 00:10:06.247
I understand

00:10:06.247 --> 00:10:08.400
Whatever I say now, you will not trust me

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:09.525
Please beat me

00:10:09.525 --> 00:10:11.478
Just stab me as you wish

00:10:11.478 --> 00:10:13.544
As long as you go see him

00:10:13.544 --> 00:10:16.278
and tell me if he's still fine

00:10:16.278 --> 00:10:18.009
I beg you

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:24.150
Why you cry?

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:27.955
I can use this talisman to release you anytime

00:10:27.955 --> 00:10:29.076
Really?

00:10:29.076 --> 00:10:30.806
Do you really want to?

00:10:30.806 --> 00:10:32.166
Of course not

00:10:32.166 --> 00:10:34.448
That sword is sharp, isn't it?

00:10:34.448 --> 00:10:37.305
You used it to injure Duanmu

00:10:37.305 --> 00:10:40.181
If you dare to pierce your chest

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:43.180
as what you did to Duanmu,

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:45.020
I will then release you

00:10:45.027 --> 00:10:46.200
Don't worry

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.640
If you're truly faithful to your master,

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:50.570
you won't get any injury

00:10:50.574 --> 00:10:52.839
but if you have any doubts,

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.220
it must be really painful to get dissipated eh?

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:59.450
But it's nothing compared what Duanmu experienced

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:01.850
What?

00:11:01.857 --> 00:11:03.029
Are you scared?

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:04.990
If I do it

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:06.200
you will trust me, right?

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.350
That's right

00:11:07.357 --> 00:11:09.295
I'm scared of pain

00:11:09.295 --> 00:11:10.513
and death

00:11:10.513 --> 00:11:12.952
I always run away from fear

00:11:12.952 --> 00:11:14.111
but this time

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.820
I don't want to run anymore!

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.310
Why?

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:31.391
Let me forewarn you

00:11:31.391 --> 00:11:33.471
Once you step out of this boundary,

00:11:33.471 --> 00:11:36.536
it proves that you're challenging the Duanmu family

00:11:36.536 --> 00:11:39.469
From now on, the Duanmus will not treat you kindly

00:11:39.469 --> 00:11:40.723
Of course,

00:11:40.723 --> 00:11:42.346
you're free to stay here

00:11:42.346 --> 00:11:44.360
and pretend nothing happens

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:46.650
Qin Siyao

00:11:46.656 --> 00:11:47.805
Thank you

00:11:50.992 --> 00:11:52.195
Fool

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:53.520
I'm actually the one

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.600
who can't do anything

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:00.760
Duanmu Xi

00:12:00.761 --> 00:12:02.149
I always thought

00:12:02.149 --> 00:12:04.445
you're cold, pompous, and hard to understand

00:12:04.445 --> 00:12:06.008
However, the more I know you,

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:08.500
the more I feel ashamed of myself

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:11.430
Perhaps I really don't qualify to be your Soul Image

00:12:11.433 --> 00:12:13.195
but since you've chosen me

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:14.740
Hope you don't mind

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:16.620
me making a fool of myself

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:19.210
Allow me to stay by your side

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.360
even if the worst is to come

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:23.860
I will never let go of you

00:12:24.586 --> 00:12:26.368
I'll prove to everyone

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:28.340
that you've chosen the right person

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:33.100
He has in fact chosen the wrong person

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.960
Resign himself to all misery schemed by me

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:37.860
You reap what you've sown, Young Master

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.700
What are you trying to do?

00:12:39.703 --> 00:12:41.250
I'm here to

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:44.703
take back what belongs to mine
